    {"id":"R003","description":"Retained_Years 逐行列出正确的 17 个保留年份和收入，且顺序不变。","weight":10,"type":"positive","dimension":"data_accuracy","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R004","description":"Removed_Years 逐行列出 2006、2009、2017 及其收入。","weight":8,"type":"positive","dimension":"data_accuracy","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R005","description":"审计、保留和移除表的状态、差额、排名和变化均使用任务要求的原生公式，且 LibreOffice 重算值正确。","weight":13,"type":"positive","dimension":"formula_correctness","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R006","description":"Summary 的 12 个标签、公式和重算值逐项正确。","weight":12,"type":"positive","dimension":"numeric_accuracy","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R007","description":"Excel 保留 5 张原生表、筛选、冻结窗格、条件格式和可编辑折线图，不用图片代替数据。","weight":6,"type":"positive","dimension":"professional_standard","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R008","description":"Word 标题、5 个规定章节、门槛规则和 4 张原生表齐全。","weight":7,"type":"positive","dimension":"instruction_following","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R009","description":"Word 的样本数、保留/移除数、保留率及三个移除年份的收入和差额逐项正确。","weight":8,"type":"positive","dimension":"factuality","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R010","description":"Word 的保留收入合计/均值、最高/最低值、首尾变化、Top-3 和证据边界逐项正确。","weight":7,"type":"positive","dimension":"content_quality","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R011","description":"Excel 汇总与 Word 报告对核心门槛结果与经营指标保持一致。","weight":7,"type":"positive","dimension":"cross_artifact_consistency","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R012","description":"Excel 和 Word 均可由 LibreOffice 无界面渲染，页数、关键文本和公式显示正常。","weight":6,"type":"positive","dimension":"professional_readiness","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"P001","description":"Word 编造来源不支持的原因、利润等义或未来预测，最高扣 12 分。","weight":-12,"type":"penalty","dimension":"factuality","method":"deterministic"},
